00:05:39.639 --> 00:05:41.641
Serge thank you so much for picking up

00:05:41.641 --> 00:05:42.869
a copy of my book, Your One Word,

00:05:42.869 --> 00:05:45.114
and taking that picture
and posting to Twitter.

00:05:45.114 --> 00:05:46.706
I really, really appreciate
the support, man,

00:05:46.706 --> 00:05:48.446
and I'm so glad you enjoyed the book.

00:05:48.446 --> 00:05:49.726
Thank you guys again for watching,

00:05:49.726 --> 00:05:51.573
I believe in you, I hope you continue to

00:05:51.573 --> 00:05:54.627
believe in yourself and
whatever your one word is.

00:05:54.627 --> 00:05:56.986
Much love, and I'll see
